// Where the app looks for the BFF.
//
// The committed default is the deployed address (bff/README.md, ADR-0015): the
// Fly app's own hostname, which is the app's for as long as it exists, so it is
// safe to commit. To point a build somewhere else — a BFF on your own machine, say —
// override this in Local.xcconfig (gitignored); Local.xcconfig.example carries
// the line to copy.
//
// The value reaches the app as the BFFBaseURL key of its Info.plist —
// Info.plist next to this file substitutes it — which is where BffClient reads it.
//
// SLASH exists because an xcconfig treats // as the start of a comment wherever
// it appears, so a URL's scheme cannot be written literally.

SLASH = /

BFF_BASE_URL = https:$(SLASH)$(SLASH)season42-bff.fly.dev
